### 4.13 AI Agent

A separate screen opened from Home. No new tab.

**Capabilities (guide screen)**

- READY: look things up, transactions, wallets, transfers, budgets, categories, recurring, purchase plans.
- COMING SOON: loans and debts. The guide card must keep the title **"PURCHASE PLANS"** until the agent has loan tools.

**Rules (authoritative)**

1. A default key comes from `.env`. A key saved in Settings overrides it. REMOVE falls back to the default.
2. Hold-to-talk is docked at the bottom. The agent speaks its replies (speaker icon to mute).
3. English, Bangla and Banglish are supported.
4. **Every write action needs confirmation, with a PREVIEW and a way to EDIT before approving.**
5. A privacy notice and an on/off switch live in Settings.

**Layout:** the guide is the landing page. BACK from chat goes to the guide first. The guide can be revisited without clearing the chat. Chat-only icons are hidden on the guide. Do not return to the round mic, the two-row dock, or heavy nested guide cards.

**Usage bar:** shows tokens used and left. The API only returns per-call usage, so remaining = user-typed LIMIT − USED. Until a limit is set, it shows a labeled `EST.` default of 250K.

**Technical**

- REST `POST https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/interactions`
- Headers: `x-goog-api-key`, `Content-Type: application/json`, `Api-Revision: 2026-05-20`.
- Body: `model`, `input`, `tools`, `store: false` (stateless).
- All steps are resent in order, including model `thought` and `function_call` steps unchanged.
- No system-instruction field, so rules are prefixed to the first user step.
- Function result step: `{ type: "function_result", name, call_id, result: [{ type: "text", text: <JSON string> }] }`.
- **Web dev only:** the endpoint is blocked by CORS, so run `node scripts/ai-dev-proxy.cjs` (port 8787). The phone calls Google directly.
- **Tools** (`AGENT_TOOLS` at module level in `agent.tsx`): read tools, write tools, transfer tools, and 15 manage tools (budgets, categories, recurring, plans). **Loan tools are not built yet.**
- Files: `ai-client.ts`, `ai-storage.ts`, `use-ai-usage.ts`, `use-ai-settings.ts`, `ai-agent.ts`, `ai-tools.ts`, `ai-write-tools.ts`, `ai-transfer-tools.ts`, `ai-manage-tools.ts`, `use-ai-chat.ts`, `agent-preview-card.tsx`, `agent-guide.tsx`, `speak.ts`.
- History compaction (dropping thought/tool steps from older turns) is an assumption. If the API rejects a long chat (more than 4 messages), use CLEAR.
- The manage tools are 🟡 untested. Tests: set a Food budget, add/pause/delete a rent rule, add and delete a Pets category, add a smart-watch plan and mark it bought.

